# Include your custom_postgui HAL commands here
# This file will not be overwritten when you run PNCconf again


########extra stuff i think needs to be loaded after linuxcnc starts up#######
net joint-5-mag-position mag.0.tool-prep-pocket-out 
net J6:out atc.0.atc-in-position
net joint-6-atc-position j6.limit3.in atc.0.atc-out-position 

########extra stuff i think needs to be loaded after linuxcnc starts up#######


 

# Auto tool measure side panel (toolmeasure.xml), added 2026-10-11
source toolmeasure_postgui.hal

# Toolchanger tab of the side panel (status, fault reset, put pot back), added 2026-10-14
source toolchanger_postgui.hal

# Jog speeds = the AXIS jog sliders (the knob moves both, see axisrc.py).
# frontpanel.hal picks one of these for halui depending on which jog button is
# held. axisui pins only exist once the GUI is up.
net jog-lspeed <= axisui.jog-speed     # mm/min slider  - X Y Z
net jog-aspeed <= axisui.jog-aspeed    # deg/min slider - A B
